window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Knowing her is dangerous. Loving her is lethal. Between working a new angle on an old case and learning to control her dreams, Cassie Woods has more than her fair share of drama. A devastating revelation rocks her world, forcing her to acknowledge the unthinkable and fight for what she wants. But nothing is ever as it seems, and a bunch of people want her dead. The past keeps coming back to haunt her in new and profound ways.</p> <p>Someone is skimming money from the Slippery Pole...</p> <p>Someone is lurking in the shadows...</p> <p>Someone embraces their inner stripper...</p> <p>She did what?!</p> <p>He did what?!</p> <p>Oh, Tequila!</p>"; 
